Session 56 complete. Summary:

**Direction:** FOCUS-2 amendment from S55 — extend the Liouville-parity attack from q=2 to q ∈ {3, 5, 7, 11, 13} via character-twisted sums L_χ(x) = Σ λ(n)χ(n).

